   },
   "isi": {
    "id": "KPK menyita Rp2 miliar dari Bobby Rasyidin, Dirut PT KAI, terkait dugaan korupsi digitalisasi SPBU. Beberapa media melaporkan ia mengembalikan dana tersebut, sementara media lain menyatakan ia diduga menerima dana itu.",
    "en": "The KPK seized Rp2 billion from Bobby Rasyidin, CEO of PT KAI, in connection with alleged corruption in SPBU digitalisation. Some outlets report he returned the money, while others say he is alleged to have received it."
